{"about_the_game":"Stellaxy is a space exploration RPG adventure game with a massive Universe with over a billion planets to explore!<br><br><br>You are the first astronaut being sent out  to be an ambassador of Earth. Your mission is to explore the Universe for anomalies spotted by scientists back home.<br><br>Discover aliens that span across the once thought cold dead universe, and learn about their cultures. <br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Upgrade your ship to make it a killing machine, or to your visual liking. <br></li><li>Fight against tyrannical alien races that have taken over many solar systems throughout the universe! <br></li><li>Trade with the peaceful species and learn about them. <br></li><li>Complete all the challenges to 100% the game. <br></li><li>93 Achievements to unlock<br></li><li>Complete quests given to you by allies! <br></li><li>Over 40 different alien species to learn about!<br></li><li>Procedurally generated textures!<br></li><li>Runs on basically ANY PC!  <br></li><li>Collect 250+ unique items!<br></li><li>Visit Parallel Universes!<br></li><li>Discover the Mysteries of the Stellaxy Universe!<br></li><li>Create fun and interesting mods for the community to try!</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"80cef66173640d87d915886f80b795efb4b81fef.jpg","localized_name":"Meet a Djelv","name":"Meet a Djelv","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1226890/80cef66173640d87d915886f80b795efb4b81fef.jpg"},{"icon":"315ef24e7bd7ea17aac7c7ac1dd61eba0a2a1497.jpg","localized_name":"Meet a Skia","name":"Meet a Skia","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1226890/315ef24e7bd7ea17aac7c7ac1dd61eba0a2a1497.jpg"},{"icon":"b9a6940cc95ca042a51af51cfbddc869ccfe9983.jpg","localized_name":"Meet an Ourti","name":"Meet an Ourti","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1226890/b9a6940cc95ca042a51af51cfbddc869ccfe9983.jpg"},{"icon":"63c8c8ba17f8be2350c